{"description": "Mixed salad greens: fresh green and dark red-purple leaves, some curly and some flat, lightly wilted at edges, covering roughly a quarter of the plate on the upper left; no visible dressing sheen.", "candidates": ["mixed salad greens", "baby spinach leaves", "lettuce mix with herbs"], "grams": 60},
{"description": "Scrambled eggs: pale yellow, soft clumped curds with slight moisture and a fine sheen, spread across the upper right of the plate, roughly a sixth of the plate area and a couple of centimeters thick.", "candidates": ["scrambled eggs cooked with butter", "scrambled eggs with milk", "egg whites scramble"], "grams": 110},
{"description": "Red-orange thick sauce or salsa: glossy, smooth to slightly chunky, pooled over the eggs and salad, with a few drips on the plate rim; moderate thickness.", "candidates": ["tomato salsa", "ketchup", "hot sauce or chili sauce"], "grams": 40},
{"description": "Small round sausage patties or links: about 25 pieces, golden-brown and browned on the outside with a dry, slightly crisp surface, each about 3 cm wide and 1 cm thick, clustered across the lower half of the plate.", "candidates": ["pork breakfast sausage patties", "chicken sausage rounds", "turkey sausage slices"], "grams": 230},
{"description": "Oil or grease drippings: small glossy reddish-orange smears and droplets along the lower right edge of the plate near the sausage.", "candidates": ["cooking oil", "sausage fat drippings", "sauce residue"], "grams": 8}
]}
